

MHC Acquisition Research MasterPage 1
MHC Acquisition Research Master
USA public mobile home community listings organized into one acquisition-screening PDF. Public data only; verify all figures against OM, rent roll, T12, utility bills,
title/survey, zoning, licenses, and broker diligence.
MetricValueMeaning
Listings Captured468Total public source rows collected
Priced Listings437Rows with numeric asking/listing price
Median Asking Price$1,300,000Median across priced listings
Lot/Space Coverage354Rows with lots, spaces, pads, or sites
Total Lots/Spaces Found14,301Sum where counts were public
Reported NOI Coverage105Rows with reported NOI
NOI or Implied NOI145Reported NOI plus implied NOI from price/cap
Cap Rate Coverage147Rows with cap-rate signal
Occupancy Coverage119Rows with occupancy signal
TOH/POH Coverage72Rows with tenant-owned or park-owned home count
Reader NoteDetails
How to read itStart with the shortlist, then use the full database appendix for all captured listings.
Best target signalHigh score plus reported NOI/cap rate, lot count, occupancy, and city/public utility signal.
Blank fieldsBlank means the public listing text did not expose the field, not that the metric is zero.
Follow-up packageAsk for OM, rent roll, T12, utility bills, POH inventory, debt terms, zoning/license status, and capex history.
Refresh dateJune 2, 2026

