MHC Acquisition Research MasterPage 7
Field Guide
FieldMeaningHow to Use It
Data StrengthCompleteness label based on public fields found.Prioritize High/Medium rows for follow-up.
NOINet operating income reported by the source.Verify against T12 and rent roll.
Implied NOINOI estimated from price and cap-rate data.Use only as a screening proxy.
TOHTenant-owned homes.Generally cleaner than POH-heavy operations.
POHPark-owned homes.Requires home inventory, condition review, and capex diligence.
Price per LotAsking price divided by lot/space count.Useful for quick market comparison.
OccupancyReported occupancy signal.Verify physical and economic occupancy.
City/Public UtilitiesListing suggests public utility service.Often preferred to private systems.
SubmeteredListing suggests utilities are submetered.Can indicate recoverable utility expense or upside.
Acquisition ScoreHeuristic score from public financial and operational signals.Sorting aid only.

